    "prespecified": "Fixed 2026-11-21 after the classes-18 pilot (run 44926451797: 0 deaths in all eight arms, 18/18 identical plays for the\nname arms, 17/18 for the stats arms: the arms were mostly not exercised there). Small tier (RULES 14): the five arms the\nowner asked for (ctl, named, named-ban, stats, stats-ban), 90 starts each, classes-1800 starts 1-90, all classes, one\nbinary, 100,000 turns. The three variants that added nothing over named in the pilot (esc75, attack-only, ban-exc) are\ndropped.\nGate: no config_error; one binary; every cell ends in death, turn_cap or borg_stopped; stalls reported start by start\n(lightless aborts apart); frozen-turn bursts classified.\nReport per arm and class: deaths and causes (crow and wild cat apart), CL at death, final and maximum level; paired\nrescued and newly killed against ctl (exact McNemar), identical plays; the other fast-fragile deaths (cave spiders,\ncentipedes, bats); small and medium pooled as one study of 360 starts (RULES 14); a RULES 18 bin. Descriptive.",
